## 1. Course Introduction

<p><strong>Mathematics: Analysis and Approaches (AA) Higher Level (HL)</strong> focuses on developing strong analytical and rational thinking skills. The course emphasizes rigorous mathematical proofs, algebraic methods, and deep concepts of calculus and algebraic analysis. It is highly recommended for students aiming to study Computer Science, Engineering, Physics, or Mathematics at premier universities worldwide.</p>

